fastEukaryotyping is a reimplementation of the Eukaryotyping distance
ensemble originally developed for Cyclospora cayetanensis MLST data.

Original R implementation and algorithms:
  Joel Barratt, Mateusz Plucinski, Felipe Nascimento and colleagues
  CDC / Division of Parasitic Diseases and Malaria
  Source: https://github.com/Joel-Barratt/Eukaryotyping

Method publication:
  Barratt JLN et al. (2019) "A Genotyping Approach to Determine the
  Geographic Origin and Relatedness of Cyclospora cayetanensis"
  Journal of Parasitology / Parasitology
  doi:10.1017/S0031182019000581

This package (C++17/Rcpp port, API design, validation):
  Angel Luis Robles Fernandez <a.l.robles.fernandez@gmail.com>

All code in this package is distributed under GPL (>= 3), consistent
